@@ -0,0 +1,972 @@
+/*
+ * Wayland driver system tray: StatusNotifierItem (SNI) over D-Bus
+ *
+ * Wayland has no XEmbed-style tray, so the icons that explorer receives
+ * through Shell_NotifyIcon are exported as org.kde.StatusNotifierItem
+ * objects, which bars like waybar, KDE Plasma, AGS/quickshell etc. show.
+ *
+ * Only the explorer process runs this. Every icon gets its own private
+ * session bus connection with its own well-known name, so removing an
+ * icon is just closing that connection (hosts drop items whose name owner
+ * vanished). All D-Bus work happens in one thread (systray_run), the
+ * NotifyIcon calls only update the icon data and wake that thread.
+ *
